The {{r|Treasure Room}} item pool contains the majority of the game's items. All of the items in this pool are able to be found in the Treasure Room. 

This pool is also used for random items spawned in any other regular room or room without a specified item pool such as {{r|Vault}}s, {{r|Arcade}}s, {{r|Boss Rush}} etc.

